fastgltf v0.9.1 for gl_test on the A53's standalone BSP (sdk/gltf), applied by make vitis
(VITIS_PATCHES, bd/gpu_test/Makefile).

FASTGLTF_HAS_FILE_SYSTEM, 0 on bare metal: no loading by path (GltfDataBuffer::FromPath,
GltfFileStream), no external buffers or images (Error::MissingExternalBuffer), no FileExporter.
Their std::filesystem operations and file streams need system calls the BSP does not have (stat,
mkdir, getcwd, ...): the program would not link.

base64.cpp: the NEON decoder's vector types converted explicitly (vreinterpretq), for GCC, which
does not convert them implicitly without -flax-vector-conversions. The same code, less one
redundant AND.

